                changelog: ["Features", "CMD_PROC_MAPS now augments the vm_map list with Sony-aux regions", "(SceGnm/SceAgc/JIT/DMEM) that bypass vm_map, discovered via a kernel-side", "x86-64 page-table walk over the DMAP. FW-agnostic (runtime pmap-offset", "discovery + ground-truth validation); falls back to the plain vm_map result", "on any failure.", "Hybrid memory-read path: reads route DMAP-direct for vm_map-absent (aux)", "regions and mdbg otherwise (and as fallback), improve aux scans performance on", "both the CMD_PROC_READ and server-side scan paths. No protocol change;", "byte-identical results."]
